    "anchor": "12.07",
    "summary": "Both players may make a **[consolidation move](vsdata:core-rule/consolidation-move)** with each eligible unit they choose; the move's Eligible If section sets eligibility. Moves do not alternate:\n\n1. The player taking the turn moves all their units.\n2. Then their opponent moves theirs.\n\nNo unit consolidates more than once in this step.",
